      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VIA SATELLITE (2) broke through for her maiden success two back but could manage only midfield last time when finished fifth and beaten 6 lengths at this track over 350m (20.38). Drawn well from box 2. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. KNIGHT EXPRESS (1) was unfavoured last start but gave a huge sight when led for much of the way to place (25.69) at this track in a Grade 5 over 450m. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Bold showing expected. ROBELL RUMI (4) boxed on well to finish second last time, beaten one length (20.38) behind Orara Bob at this track. Expected to be in the finish again. ANNDAR SPIRIT (8) is worth including.",
